{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "5616404685d2a4a4e76ad547a7c2096b2a5acab085a9112b22c4cc99ca9d1f3e", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　見て見て！\nわたしの新しい衣装、似合ってる？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！快看快看！\n我的新服装，适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1001_p", "source_sha256": "50f70d4121c73989f3a5ed2fd427c67cae6ba1296913342b1d5c6bc1b6e1f4a7", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ！\n……育、これで何回目だ？　感想聞くの。", "zh": "啊，很合适哦！\n……育，这已经是第几次了？你总来问我的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "31fcfa39bea260798885493be1e124e04a3f858fda2c9f2e01045bba02d43533", "ja": "えへへ……だって、{$P$}さんに\n似合うってほめてもらえるの、うれしいんだもん♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……因为能被{$P$}先生夸说很适合我，我很开心嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b53f550ea1c2b2b7aff1b2426aa988bba441bf2a2d0ca26153393d64b14dc543", "ja": "そうか。喜んでくれるなら、何度でも褒めるけどな！\nけど、本当にその衣装が気に入ったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。只要你开心，我夸多少次都行！\n\n不过，你是真的很喜欢那套服装啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "7ed1fadada3356e0acc521e4989cbaa717bf30b75998cc8610a383b6ae07dd18", "ja": "うん！　とってもかわいいし、きれいだし！\n動くと、腰のリボンがひらひらって揺れるんだよ♪", "zh": "嗯！既可爱又漂亮！\n\n一动起来，腰间的蝴蝶结就会轻飘飘地摇动哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b361abfbc56bd8eb9b01492db475a8f8dd6bdf13d9b8c130471a860a9b5873f", "ja": "桃子ちゃんと環ちゃんも、\n新しい衣装をもらったんでしょ？", "zh": "桃子和环也拿到新衣服了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cc379386239fa6b0f43f3b8829e8d8c4f7ce972c382c8f746159cc72ec8432b5", "ja": "そうだよ。ふたりから聞いたのか？", "zh": "是啊。你从她们俩那里听说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "8cb4a4a3c4e27dc8ac8657a4216b58968db194b03d50e179f4d6f79861c46256", "ja": "うん！\nふたりも、すっごくよろこんでたよ！", "zh": "嗯！\n她们俩也特别开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "a56b7e4d70b0868c7273273f6ee0049c180c3c739a436ecd2ddf64d01307e4d7", "ja": "3人とも、ちょっとふんいきが似てるねとか。\nこの衣装で、カバーを歌うんだーとか……。", "zh": "比如觉得我们3个人气质有点像啦，\n还有原来要穿这套服装唱翻唱曲啊……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d4ee5a17d1f2ab66e8cf0b937c014c78eca8dfdfa0d52d4eeaf0102f6df991f", "ja": "あとね。わたし、\nもっとがんばらなきゃ！って思ったんだ♪", "zh": "还有呢。我觉得，\n自己必须要更加努力才行！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fc39e5f2163b3be01316551e8455db15ccdaa11f7725f16d8bf85917dae29b72", "ja": "……？\n頑張らなきゃ、っていうのは……？", "zh": "……？\n你说的必须加油，是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "c994428f77d3afdd0a10937a4a7021c171a391d68eb82e589c6abecc5f5ed31f", "ja": "だって、衣装はみんな同じくらいかわいいんだから。\nあとはダンスや歌で、がんばるしかないでしょ？", "zh": "因为服装都一样可爱嘛。\n接下来就只能在舞蹈和歌唱上下功夫了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "8d0378aa98018dc4c9fc7f1399747c9fb1184cd745cc44c867052bf517e5495c", "ja": "桃子ちゃんや環ちゃんに負けないくらい、ファンの\nみんなに、わたしのことステージで見てほしいもん！", "zh": "我想让粉丝们在舞台上看到我，不能输给桃子和环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "a06fcd35fc6ac1d2298c20dcb3bec857de593daf414255079ec2864492ad56ff", "ja": "あれ？　……それって、変かな？", "zh": "奇怪？　……这么想，会很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "efb84a052c10e8ceb542d7ed77b2e6dc8c84f82d76061e12dd883fdd8ccaf284", "ja": "いや、そんな事はない。育の言うとおりだ。\nふたりに負けないように、頑張らないとだな！", "zh": "不，没那回事。就像育说的那样。\n为了不输给你们两个，我也得努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "05b7090969a4f795782f1a3c03a5df7741e1450be6da9d5d08634b953a87475d", "ja": "うん！　誰が一番すごいか、競争なんだ。\nわたし、ぜったい負けないんだから！", "zh": "嗯！要比比看谁最厉害。\n我绝对不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1016_p", "source_sha256": "691f3725ba5781385802a443796b64c950faddcf49c104b38e3001e887b4ca47", "ja": "その調子だ。よし、なんでも協力するから、\n育がしてほしい事があったら言ってくれ！", "zh": "就是这个劲头。好，我什么都愿意帮忙，\n育有什么想让我做的就告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff421faa5074e36742ac95cb3ee2b439ced184fe4ce70e3ecccf0927d4ef7240", "ja": "ほんとう！？　えっと、それじゃあわたし……。", "zh": "真的！？　呃，那我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0434_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "a513675e575c56bc3232b85d63c465248a30be8b085e6309f13e531f080f40fd", "ja": "自信をつけたいから、{$P$}さんに\nもっと、いーっぱいほめてほしいな！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "因为我想变得更有自信，所以想让{$P$}先生多夸夸我！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
